          "title": "Order of operations",
          "lesson": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "stage": "pictorial",
                "text": "Some sums have more than one step. Everyone must do them in the same order, or we get different answers."
              },
              {
                "stage": "abstract",
                "text": "Brackets first. Then × and ÷ from left to right. Then + and − from left to right.\n10 − 2 × 3 = 10 − 6 = 4, not 24."
